.TH dumphf "1" "" "The scalpel3 Headers/Footers Dumper" "The scalpel3 Headers/Footers Dumper"

.SH NAME
dumphf \- Dump the content of a scalpel3 headers/footers database

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dumphf
[header_footer_database_pathname]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBdumphf\fR displays the header and footer counts, byte offsets, and match
lengths for each file type in a \fIheadersfooters.dat\fR database.
Scalpel3 writes this database after header/footer discovery during normal
carving as well as with \fB-H header-footer\fR. The \fB-H\fR option is not
required to produce it.

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
.TP
.I [header_footer_database_pathname]
Optional. The path to the headers/footers database file. If not specified, it defaults to "scalpel-output/headersfooters.dat".

.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns zero after displaying the database and nonzero if it cannot be read.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR scalpel3 (1),
.BR dumpbt (1)

.SH AUTHOR
Golden G. Richard III.
